# Hand-authored ground-truth book for the .ybb reader parity test.
# Positions are drawn from the existing parity-fixture SFENs (see
# tests/fixtures/perft/*.json). Move lines are `<bestmove> <ponder> <value>
# <depth> <count>`; the .ybb format stores move16/value/depth only (no ponder,
# no per-move count), so after conversion count collapses to 0.
